      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 2.5 Release Schedule",
      "source_hash": 17845687322894351403,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "Python 2.5 릴리스 일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005893Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 13813374189765591639,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005895Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the development and release schedule for Python 2.5.",
      "source_hash": 18342099446253597010,
      "context_hash": 4441648796028552222,
      "translation": "이 문서는 Python 2.5의 개발 및 릴리스 일정을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The schedule primarily concerns itself with PEP-sized items.",
      "source_hash": 8496237367836649166,
      "context_hash": 5819750772785466218,
      "translation": "이 일정은 주로 PEP 규모의 항목을 다룹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005896Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Small features may be added up to and including the first beta release.",
      "source_hash": 1982876808633537363,
      "context_hash": 9851644482084715825,
      "translation": "첫 번째 베타 릴리스까지 포함하여 작은 기능을 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Bugs may be fixed until the final release.",
      "source_hash": 16778392553909584381,
      "context_hash": 13994991339099676981,
      "translation": "최종 릴리스까지 버그를 수정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "There will be at least two alpha releases, two beta releases, and one release candidate.",
      "source_hash": 574320292695056308,
      "context_hash": 16008349470009941906,
      "translation": "알파 릴리스는 최소 두 개, 베타 릴리스는 두 개, 릴리스 후보는 하나가 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The release date is planned for 12 September 2006.",
      "source_hash": 16253933185155821062,
      "context_hash": 11079489582205043845,
      "translation": "릴리스 날짜는 2006년 9월 12일로 계획되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005897Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Release Manager",
      "source_hash": 4392981387520253530,
      "context_hash": 2708552924559050608,
      "translation": "릴리스 관리자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Anthony Baxter has volunteered to be Release Manager.",
      "source_hash": 10689958177058544100,
      "context_hash": 8934208146377365782,
      "translation": "Anthony Baxter가 릴리스 관리자를 맡겠다고 자원했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Martin von Loewis is building the Windows installers,",
      "source_hash": 13689049887924294417,
      "context_hash": 7610488284524797933,
      "translation": "Martin von Loewis는 Windows 설치 프로그램을 빌드하고 있으며,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Ronald Oussoren is building the Mac installers,",
      "source_hash": 2005294189927882544,
      "context_hash": 2098626681938172542,
      "translation": "Ronald Oussoren은 Mac 설치 프로그램을 빌드하고 있으며,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Fred Drake the doc packages and",
      "source_hash": 15961010216431719662,
      "context_hash": 13320227881950403060,
      "translation": "Fred Drake는 문서 패키지를,",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005898Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Sean Reifschneider the RPMs.",
      "source_hash": 11921101534730259737,
      "context_hash": 17789338364836348244,
      "translation": "Sean Reifschneider는 RPM을 빌드합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:14.005899Z",
      "issues": []
    },
